            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 4:26 p.m. Central Daylight Time Saturday, Environment Canada has updated a tornado warning for Parkland and Interlake Manitoba. Extra care and attention should be exercised. The following localities are included in the warning: Mossey River, Ethelbert, Grand Rapids and Waterhen. Environment Canada meteorologists are tracking a severe thunderstorm that is possibly producing a tornado. Damaging winds, large hail and locally intense rainfall are also possible. Take cover immediately if threatening weather approaches. Please consult local media for more information.</value>
        </parameter>
